abstract: >-
  Disease Intelligence. Connected. Open-source research software for connecting disease knowledge, evidence, and provenance across biomedical sources.
  NosoGraph combines disease knowledge graphs, universal ontology imports,
  evidence gathering, and explainable research pipelines. Public alpha;
  research use only. Registry coverage is not equivalent to curation depth.
